/-!
# Data of the `μ > 0` passing guiding-centre torus family certificate (low resolution, part 1)

Stored Chebyshev coefficients (`SliceData`, `Certificates/KronChebCompute`) of the centres of the
low-resolution family ball pipeline (`Design/RationalStellaratorGCMu2EnvL`): layout `N = 16`,
`M = 12`,
Chebyshev degree `D = 5`, scale `2^{−60}`. Generated by the untrusted oracle
`scripts/gc_kam/lam_cert.py`, `lam_emit_lean.py`; nothing here is trusted.

Pitch cell `λ ∈ [1/16, 1/8]`: modules `RationalStellaratorGCMu2*`,
namespace `PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC.Mu2`; generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/lamcell` from the pipeline of the cell `[0, 1/16]`.
-/

@[expose] public section

